{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16003","headline":"行宫词 · 王建","name":"行宫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上阳宫到蓬莱殿，行宫岩岩遥相见。\n向前天子行幸多，马蹄车辙山川遍。\n当时州县每年修，皆留内人看玉案。\n禁兵夺得明堂後，长闭桃源与绮绣。\n开元歌舞古草头，梁州乐人世嫌旧。\n官家乏人作宫户，不泥宫墙斫宫树。\n两边仗屋半崩摧，夜火入林烧殿柱。\n休封中岳六十年，行宫不见人眼穿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}